sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant App as Blazor Server
    participant AI as Gemini x10 parallel
    participant DB as Table Storage

    U->>App: Submit bulk prompt
    App->>DB: Persist BulkPrompt (Pending)
    App->>AI: 10 concurrent GenerateImage calls
    AI-->>App: Images streamed as each completes
    App->>DB: Store each ImageResult
    App-->>U: Live slot-by-slot UI updates via SignalR
    App->>DB: Mark BulkPrompt Complete
